### 25.1 Overview

This section identifies all standalone builder classes in the codebase that need to be integrated back into their host classes following the AI development rules. The builder pattern should be implemented as nested static classes within the host classes, following the established openHAB patterns.

**Current State Assessment:**
- The codebase has a mix of standalone builder classes and some nested builder implementations
- Many configuration classes already have comments indicating builders were "extracted to top-level"
- Some classes like `ModelIntegrationStatistics` already have proper nested builder implementations
- The plan needs to address both standalone builders and ensure consistency with openHAB patterns

